			[1] = {"S?頲 phong l? Thanh Li猲 Ti猲 T?<enter>H鋍 頲 v?c玭g: L璾 Th駓<enter>N琲 ti誴 nh薾 nhi謒 v? T?Thi猲 甶謓 <color=yellow>B竔 Nguy謙 Ti猲 T?color> T?T?Hinh.<enter>C竎 bc th鵦 hi謓 nhi謒 v?enter><color=red>Bc 1: <color>дn T?Thi猲 甶謓 (246,304) g苝 T?T?Hinh, ti誴 nh薾 nhi謒 v?t譵 B筩h 觰 Tri襲 Ph鬾g kh骳 ph?<enter><color=red>Bc 2: <color>дn Th祅h Й -> Thanh Th祅h S琻 -> Th莕 Ti猲 чng. V祇 trong ng t譵 Cao nh﹏ (234,204), 玭g ta s?y猽 c莡 B筺 nh b筰 con Linh th?(235,203).<enter><color=red>Bc 3: <color>Sau khi nh b筰 n? b筺 l筰 nh蕄 v祇 l阨 tho筰 v韎 Cao nh﹏. g ta y猽 c莡 b筺 mang b鴆 tranh Ph?Dung C萴 K?n i kh骳 ph?<enter><color=red>Bc 4: <color>дn Th竔 B譶h Ti猽 C鬰 ?Th祅h Й ph? g苝 玭g ch?Ti猽 C鬰 (376,316), nh蕄 v祇 l阨 tho筰, 玭g ta y猽 c莡 b筺 t譵 Linh X?Hng nang, g T譶h H?Th﹏ ph?v?B輈h T?Gi韎 Ch? s?giao Ph?Dung C萴 K?<enter><color=red>Bc 5: <color>V祇 trong th祅h 甶 t譵 ba ngi, b筺 s?l蕐 頲 ba m鉵 b秓 v藅 n鉯 tr猲 :<enter>- Linh X?Hng nang: дn Th祅h Й t譵 Ti誸 Ti觰 mu閕 (383,315), nh蕄 v祇 l阨 tho筰, Ti誸 Ti觰 mu閕 y猽 c莡 b筺 mang Ng﹏ thi襪 (Tr﹎ c礽) n i. дn ti謒 t筽 h鉧 mua Ng﹏ thi襪 (386,321) v韎 gi?200 lng. Tr?l筰 g苝 Ti誸 Ti觰 mu閕, d飊g Ng﹏ thi襪 (Tr﹎ c礽) i Hng nang. <enter>- g T譶h H?Th﹏ ph? T譵 g苝 T?V﹏ Ph竝 S?t筰 T輓 Tng t?(403,319) ?Th祅h Й ph? l莕 lt tr?l阨 ba c﹗ h醝, s?nh薾 頲 g T譶h H?Th﹏ ph? (Цp 竛 l莕 lt l? B, D, C). N誹 nh?p sai, b筺 c?th?nh蕄 v祇 l阨 tho筰  th鵦 hi謓 l筰. <enter>- B輈h T?Gi韎 Ch? дn Th祅h Й t譵 T﹏ Vi猲 Ngo筰 (400,309), tr?l阨 hai c﹗ h醝 s?nh薾 頲 B輈h T?Gi韎 Ch?(Цp 竛 l?: B, C). N誹 nh?p sai, b筺 c?th?nh蕄 v祇 l阨 tho筰  th鵦 hi謓 l筰.<enter><color=red>Bc 6: <color>Tr?l筰 Th竔 B譶h Ti猽 C鬰 ?Th祅h Й ph? giao Linh X?Hng nang, g T譶h H?Th﹏ ph?v?B輈h T?Gi韎 Ch? i Ph?Dung C萴 K?<enter><color=red>Bc 7: <color>Tr?v?Th莕 Ti猲 ng, g苝 Cao nh﹏, nh蕄 v祇 l阨 tho筰, d飊g Ph?Dung C萴 K?i B竎h 觰 Tri襲 Phong.<enter><color=red>Bc 8: <color>Tr?v?Nga My ph竔, n T?Thi猲 甶謓 g苝 T?T?Hinh, giao B竎h 觰 Tri襲 Phong, ho祅 th祅h nhi謒 v?"},
