		[3] = {
			[1] = {"S?頲 phong l? <color=yellow>Nh蕋 Ph萴 Hoa S?color>. H鋍 頲 v?c玭g: <color=yellow>V?Ф L?Hoa, Ph?V﹏ T祅 Tuy誸<color>. N琲 ti誴 nh薾 nhi謒 v? <color=yellow>B竎h Hoa 甶謓, H?M?Tuy誸<color>.<enter><color=red>Bc 1<color>: дn B竎h Hoa 謓 <color=yellow>(53/85)<color> g苝 <color=yellow>H?M?Tuy誸<color>, ti誴 nh薾 nhi謒 v?<enter><color=red>Bc 2<color>: дn <color=yellow>Чi L?color> t譵 <color=yellow>祅 L穙 H竛 (189/204)<color>, v鮝 g苝 th?th蕐 <color=yellow>祅 L穙 H竛<color> 產ng kh鉩 l鉩 產u bu錸, bi誸 頲 con g竔 l穙 b?<color=yellow>Th?Ph?color> b総 甶.<enter><color=red>Bc 3<color>:  v?ph輆 t﹜ th祅h, n 觤 Thng S琻, 甶 v祇 Th?ph?s琻 ng <color=yellow>(232/172)<color>, gi誸 t猲 Th?ph?<color=yellow>(232/193)<color> b筺 c?th?c鴘 頲 con g竔 c馻 祅 L穙 H竛 nh璶g x竎 su蕋 r蕋 th蕄.<enter><color=red>Bc 4<color>: Tr?l筰 g苝 <color=yellow>祅 L穙 H竛<color>, nh蕄 v祇 l阨 tho筰, bi誸 頲 c莕 ph秈 甶 t譵 ba lo筰 dc li謚.<enter><color=red>Bc 5<color>: дn B課 T祏 t譵 m閠 Thuy襫 gia <color=yellow>(204/183)<color>, b?1000 lng mua 頲 v礽 con Ng﹏ Tuy誸 Ng?<enter><color=red>Bc 6<color>: V祇 Th祅h Чi L?n su鑙 H?謕, s?th蕐 hai con bm B輈h Thng Ph鬾g 謕 <color=yellow>(184/196)<color>, b筺 ch?c莕 nh蕄 chu閠 v祇 m閠 con, s?th蕐 xu蕋 hi謓 d遪g ch?<color=yellow>Nh薾 頲 B輈h Thng Ph鬾g 謕<color>, b筺 ch?c莕 l蕐 m閠 con l?.<enter><color=red>Bc 7<color>: дn V﹏ L閚g ёnh, t譵 m閠 con Th籲 l籲  <color=yellow>(182/197)<color>, nh蕄 chu閠 v祇 n? s?th蕐 xu蕋 hi謓 d遪g ch? <color=yellow>Nh薾 頲 th籲 l籲 <color> (S?h琲 kh?t譵 v?n?bi m竔 nh che khu蕋), b筺 ch?c莕 l蕐 m閠 con l?.<enter><color=red>Bc 8<color>: Sau khi t譵 頲 ba lo筰 dc li謚 tr猲, tr?v?Th髖 Y猲 m玭, giao cho H?M?Tuy誸, ho祅 th祅h nhi謒 v?"},
